  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>通过本整合包，你可以获得专属的替身，并探索海量建筑，从而体验《JOJO的奇妙冒险》的世界。为了提升探索乐趣与联机体验，我添加了几款生活便利类模组，例如 Lootr（允许你和好友拥有独立的箱子战利品）、FTB Essentials（支持使用 /tpa 指令传送至好友身边）以及 Ultimine（允许你同时挖掘大量方块）。</strong><br><br><strong>祝大家游戏愉快！</strong><br><br>模组列表：&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers (by Biban_Auriu)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldedit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldEdit (by sk89q)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty (by Forstride)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-third-person\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Third Person (by Socolio)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks (by YaLTeR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry (by ObliviousSpartan)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui (by Virtuoel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast (by RaphiMC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastworkbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">FastWorkbench (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cupboard (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lionfish-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lionfish API (by mcl_ender)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's API (Forge/NeoForge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore (by CreativeMD)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://